From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:54:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Fix Vercel deployment: config.urls resolution,
 DATABASE_URL support, build-time migrations

- Wrapper config packages now extend __path__ to framework/config, so
  config.urls resolves when Vercel imports config.wsgi (every page 500'd before)
- Support DATABASE_URL (Postgres via Neon, or mysql://) and DB_SSL for hosted MySQL
- Add psycopg, refresh uv.lock files
- build.py runs migrate during Vercel build when a hosted DB is configured
- Stop tracking __pycache__ and empty sqlite files; add root .gitignore
- Update README deploy steps

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
